 the git output, they can see that:

1. They created a file: `static/images/finaL_about_support_background.png` (note the capital L in "finaL")
2. But when they try to access it via the URL, they're getting a 404
3. The URL they mention is: `https://miamimktbodega.com/static/images/final_about_support_background.png` (note: lowercase "final")

This is a case sensitivity issue! The filename has `finaL` (with capital L) but they're trying to access it as `final` (all lowercase). On macOS (which is case-insensitive by default for the filesystem in many cases), this works fine locally, but on the Linux server (Render), the filesystem is case-sensitive, so `final_about_support_background.png` doesn't match `finaL_about_support_background.png`.

I should:
1. Check their HTML files to see how they're referencing the image
2. Confirm the actual filename in the repo
3. Help them fix this by either renaming the file or fixing the reference in their HTML

Let me look at their HTML files to see how they're using this background."},{"type":"text","text":"I see the issue!  This is a **case sensitivity problem**.

Looking at your git output:
- File created: `finaL_about_support_background.png` (capital **L**)
- URL accessing: `final_about_support_background.png` (lowercase **l**)

On macOS, the filesystem is case-insensitive, so both work locally. But Render uses Linux with a **case-sensitive** filesystem, so it can't find the file.

Let me check your HTML files to confirm how you're referencing this image:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_01B3g4yeoNXSe7ie7fuXASCA","statusText":"Viewed file (lines 1:126)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"templates/about.html","fsPath":"/Users/sandrosMac/Desktop/pycharmProjects/MiamiMkt_Store/templates/about.html"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_013Jim3x3Y7tmFd1Hsbpbu5V","statusText":"Viewed file (lines 1:132)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"templates/support.html","fsPath":"/Users/sandrosMac/Desktop/pycharmProjects/MiamiMkt_Store/templates/support.html"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"thought","text":"I see the HTML files but I don't see the background image reference being used directly in the HTML. The background is probably being set in the CSS file. Let me check the CSS file."},{"type":"text","text":"Now let me check the CSS to find where you're using this background:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_011Ne1w9SPDMyynBvTDDqcdS","statusText":"Viewed file (from the beginning up to line 400)","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"static/css/styles.css","fsPath":"/Users/sandrosMac/Desktop/pycharmProjects/MiamiMkt_Store/static/css/styles.css"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"thought","text":"Found it! In the CSS file at lines 309, 311, 352, and 354, the background image is being referenced as `../images/final_about_support_background.png` (all lowercase).

But the actual file in the git commit is `static/images/finaL_about_support_background.png` (with capital L).

On macOS (case-insensitive filesystem), both work. But on Linux (Render's server), the filesystem is case-sensitive, so it can't find the file.

The solution is to either:
1. Rename the file to match the CSS reference (all lowercase)
2. Update the CSS to match the actual filename

The easiest fix is to update the CSS to use the correct filename that's already in git: `finaL_about_support_background.png`

Or better yet, rename the file to be all lowercase to match the CSS. But first let me check what file actually exists on disk."},{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! I found the issue. In your CSS file (lines 309, 311, 352, 354), you're referencing:
```css
background-image: url("../images/final_about_support_background.png");
```

But your actual file is: `finaL_about_support_background.png` (with capital **L**)

**The fix:** Update the CSS to match the actual filename. Let me make that change:"},{"type":"toolCall","toolCallId":"toolu_016LmBRXcHNztLW9fNVTwjJ4","statusText":"Change generated","status":"SUCCESS","context":{"files":[{"path":"static/css/styles.css","fsPath":"/Users/sandrosMac/Desktop/pycharmProjects/MiamiMkt_Store/static/css/styles.css"}]},"isHidden":false},{"type":"codeHunk","lineBasedDiff":"--- /Users/sandrosMac/Desktop/pycharmProjects/MiamiMkt_Store/static/css/styles.css
